/E (This document opens the consolidated report on the activities of the Brainly HQ server for March 2026 - a space that now functions as a live ecosystem rather than just a communication channel. The past month has brought clear signals of growth: operational activity increased, the server structure was streamlined, and new technical solutions were implemented, including the official Brainly Core bot, which took over key functions related to recruitment, the currency system, and process automation.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
