/E (This report concludes one of the strongest months of organizational and technical development within Brainly HQ since the appointment of the new management board. In March, the server recorded a total of 7,495 messages, including 3,103 user messages, 3,567 bot messages, and 825 webhook messages, highlighting high activity levels and the growing role of automation. This was largely driven by the full deployment of Brainly Core, which became the central system supporting moderation, recruitment, and engagement across the server.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
